### MotoStock - Flujo DIAN/Siigo (REST Client)
### Uso:
### 1) Ajusta variables
### 2) Ejecuta en orden las requests
### 3) Copia el invoice_id devuelto para status/pdf

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = REEMPLAZA_CON_BEARER_TOKEN
@invoiceId = 1

### 0) Login (opcional, para obtener token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin

### 1) Configurar empresa + proveedor Siigo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/company-config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nit": "900123456-7",
  "company_name": "MotoStock SAS",
  "address": "Calle 123 #45-67, Bogota",
  "dian_resolution": "18760000001",
  "resolution_number": "18760000001",
  "invoice_prefix": "FV",
  "cert_path": "./certs/cert.p12",
  "cert_password": "REEMPLAZA_CERT_PASS",
  "provider": "siigo"
}

### 2) Consultar configuración actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/company-config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Crear y enviar factura (Siigo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sale_id": 1,
  "customer_document": "1010101010",
  "customer_name": "John Martinez",
  "customer_email": "john@example.com",
  "issue_date": "2026-05-08",
  "notes": "Factura emitida desde MotoStock",
  "lines": [
    {
      "product_code": "MOT7100",
      "description": "Motul 7100 10W-40 Engine Oil",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit_price": 42990,
      "tax_rate": 19
    },
    {
      "product_code": "NGK-IR",
      "description": "NGK Iridium Spark Plug",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit_price": 12990,
      "tax_rate": 19
    }
  ]
}

### 4) Consultar estado DIAN/proveedor por ID local
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Descargar PDF de factura
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

